    <briefdescription>
<para>This struct holds all the information that needs to be passed between the caller and libavcodec for initializing Videotoolbox decoding. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Its size is not a part of the public ABI, it must be allocated with av_videotoolbox_alloc_context() and freed with <ref refid="group__lavu__mem__funcs_1ga0c9096f498624c525aa2315b8a20c411" kindref="member">av_free()</ref>. </para>
